  creatureName: Acorn
  description: "I once knew a witch who liked turning chestnuts, acorns and other
    forest nuts into familiars. She sold cursed roasted chestnuts to children and
    then tracked them to turn them into more chestnuts. These are probably the ones
    that escaped into the forest.\r\n\nNote from Luc\xEDa: I used to love when October
    came and my friends bought roasted chestnuts as a snack. I never really liked
    the taste, so I didn\u2019t eat any.\r\n"
